@VIImpact_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7196
@ImpactEventId = 8bea6ace-1e23-4c44-8818-8718c016420c

### Cadastrar evento inicial de teste

POST {{VIImpact_API_HostAddress}}/api/gtaevents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "GTA VI event test",
  "description": "Temporary event used to validate the GTA VI events module.",
  "sourceUrl": "https://example.com/gta-vi-test",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-07-28T14:00:00Z"
}

### Cadastrar evento entre duas cotações

POST {{VIImpact_API_HostAddress}}/api/gtaevents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "GTA VI impact calculation test",
  "description": "Temporary event created between two collected stock quotes.",
  "sourceUrl": "https://example.com/gta-vi-impact-test",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-07-28T19:46:36Z"
}

### Listar todos os eventos

GET {{VIImpact_API_HostAddress}}/api/gtaevents
Accept: application/json

### Consultar impacto do evento sobre a TTWO

GET {{VIImpact_API_HostAddress}}/api/gtaevents/{{ImpactEventId}}/impact?symbol=TTWO
Accept: application/json